WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:02.560
What would Martin Luther think of it all?

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:08.140
500 years after the Reformation , Wittenberg
is preparing for the big anniversary.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.600
100,000 guests will attend a special service
here on the weekend

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:16.040
as part of the church's biennial congress.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.500
Construction cranes have been brought in to
build a frame to hold four church bells.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:26.160
After all, no church service would be complete
without bells.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:31.600
The crane company is used to working at great
heights, but here it's more about having a

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:35.500
wide and stable base, as the assembly manager
explains.

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:43.200
„When a bell rings, it exerts a thrust around
three times its weight, and that makes the

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.080
structure twist.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:47.080
And then the whole thing can fall over.

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:50.740
I've seen a bell frame collapse like a house
of cards."

00:00:53.380 --> 00:00:56.360
The largest bell weighs nearly three tons.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.880
For the crane company it's far from business
as usual.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:08.220
“The challenge was to decide how to build
the belltower.

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:12.440
The height is decisive in terms of the tipping
forces but so is the width.

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:14.500
We're also right by the Elbe river.

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:17.180
We don't know how the ground might behave
if it rains a lot.

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:20.360
So we've made it very wide and stable."

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:28.200
It was here in Wittenberg, 500 years ago,
that Martin Luther began speaking out against

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:32.420
the church practice of selling indulgences
to gain forgiveness for sin.

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:35.740
He drew up theses for reforming the church.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:37.860
He's said to have nailed them to this door.

00:01:38.760 --> 00:01:41.140
It sparked the birth of Protestantism.

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:45.900
Half a billion euros have been invested in
the city of Wittenberg

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:48.000
ahead of the anniversary celebrations.

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:52.580
Will enough people come and spend money to
make that investment worthwhile?

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:54.900
No one here's willing to say.

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:58.280
Many believe the anniversary can't be measured
in money.

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:02.780
One thing's for sure, an army of helpers is
making it happen.

00:02:03.400 --> 00:02:09.260
Today they're packing communion wafers - enough
for every single person who visits the church congress.

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:14.920
They'll be working for the entire year, earning
just 225 euros a month.

00:02:15.700 --> 00:02:16.620
Is it worth it?

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:23.620
"It's definitely worth it, I'd do it even
if I got no money at all.

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:29.360
You learn so much and you get to know so many
great people, you make new friends."

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:39.100
The Brückenkopf hotel in Wittenberg is also
gearing up for the anniversary

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:46.440
Right now they're awaiting the arrival of
a group of bishops from Asia.

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:49.460
The place is almost fully booked this year.

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:54.900
The owner, Renate Schult, has invested many
millions in restoring this old fortress.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:58.680
She's convinced that the investment was worthwhile.

00:02:58.680 --> 00:03:03.220
And she believes the anniversary celebrations
won't just benefit her hotel.

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:13.940
„Everyone here in Wittenberg is grateful for the business opportunities that 2017 has given us.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:18.920
I see this anniversary as a blessing for Wittenberg,
and for the whole of eastern Germany.

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:24.680
And I see it as a blessing for us Protestants
and for Christians generally who live here in the east.

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:27.100
We are the centre of attention right now."

00:03:30.860 --> 00:03:34.520
The crane company has to be very careful with
the bells.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:39.400
They're on loan from a church in Göttingen
and will only be rung once on Sunday out here

00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:40.620
on the meadow.

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:48.019
“We've never built a bell frame like this.

00:03:48.019 --> 00:03:50.230
And we're unlikely to do it again soon.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:51.080
It's quite symbolic."

00:03:58.129 --> 00:04:02.460
Could the Luther anniversary ring in a whole
new chapter for Wittenberg?

00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:05.240
It's certainly what many in this city are
hoping for.

